ARTWORK AND GAME CONTENT

The MIT license above covers the source code only. None of the images under
`assets/` are licensed by it.

Unit cards -- `assets/units/`
    Some were created by zetyrion@gmail.com; the rest are scans made by the
    author of this repository. All rights remain with their respective authors,
    and permission to use them elsewhere is theirs to give, not this
    repository's.

Tokens -- `assets/field_tokens/`, `assets/unit_tokens/`
    Some come from https://github.com/Heegu-sama/Homm3BG, a project this
    repository's author contributes to, and are used under the Creative Commons
    Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International license:
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/
    A number of them have been adapted for use here -- redrawn or renumbered --
    and those adaptations are released under that same license. The remaining
    tokens were made by the author of this repository.

Heroes of Might and Magic III, and everything the cards and tokens depict, is
the property of Ubisoft Entertainment. This is an unofficial, non-commercial
fan-made tool, built so that people can get to know the game. It is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Ubisoft.
